[00:13.26]Read the article about an astronaut's life in space, and learn about the differences between living in space and living on Earth.阅读这篇关于宇航员太空生活的文章，了解太空生活与地球生活的差异。
[00:24.37]Life in Space.太空生活。
[00:26.79]It was the proudest moment of my life.那是我一生中最自豪的时刻。
[00:30.71]We were waiting for instructions from ground control.我们正在等待地面控制中心的指令。
[00:34.90]The minutes seemed like hours.几分钟仿佛几个小时般漫长。
[00:38.17]Finally, we took off.终于，我们起飞了。
[00:40.74]We were traveling so fast, it only took about 10 minutes to get into orbit.我们的飞行速度极快，仅用了大约10分钟就进入了轨道。
[00:48.14]First, it was a shock to my body.起初，我的身体感到一阵不适。
[00:52.50]I wasn't feeling great.我感觉不太好。
[00:54.90]However, I soon adjusted and felt better.但我很快就适应了，感觉好多了。
[00:59.26]At last, we reached the space station, my new home for a while.最后，我们抵达了空间站——我接下来一段时间的新家。
[01:05.84]Let me tell you what life in space is like.让我来告诉你太空生活是什么样子的。
[01:10.62]Eating in Space太空饮食
[01:13.89]I used to worry about the food in space.我以前很担心太空里的食物。
[01:18.00]But in fact, we can choose from many types of food, such as fruit, nuts, chicken, beef and seafood.但事实上，我们有多种食物可供选择，比如水果、坚果、鸡肉、牛肉和海鲜。
[01:28.36]We have different types of tea, juice and soup as well.我们还有各种茶、果汁和汤。
[01:33.67]Turns out that eating can be a pleasure in space, too.原来在太空里吃饭也能是一种享受。
[01:39.42]Working in Space太空工作
[01:42.17]We are very busy every day.我们每天都非常忙碌。
[01:45.52]Being an astronaut is hard, because you do not experience gravity when you are in orbit.当宇航员很辛苦，因为在轨道上不会感受到重力。
[01:53.24]Everything floats, including you.所有东西都会漂浮，包括你自己。
[01:56.74]So simple tasks seem harder, and take longer to do.所以简单的任务也会变得更难，花费的时间也更长。
[02:01.65]When we go outside, we have to move very carefully.当我们走出空间站时，必须非常小心地移动。
[02:06.92]We can't afford to make any mistakes, so it can be stressful sometimes.我们不能犯任何错误，所以有时会感到有压力。
[02:13.40]However, it is an amazing experience to go outside the space station in a spacesuit.但穿着宇航服走出空间站，是一种令人惊叹的体验。
[02:20.81]The view of the Earth is great.地球的景色太美了。
[02:24.52]Sleeping in Space太空睡眠
[02:27.12]Just like on Earth, I go to bed at a certain time.和在地球上一样，我会在固定的时间睡觉。
[02:31.84]However, I sleep in a sleeping bag in a small room.但我是在一个小房间里的睡袋里睡觉。
[02:36.58]And I have to stick my sleeping bag to the wall.而且我必须把睡袋固定在墙上。
[02:40.02]This stops me from floating around the room and hitting something by mistake.这样可以防止我在房间里漂浮，不小心撞到东西。
[02:45.43]Exercising in Space太空锻炼
[02:48.34]Exercise is an important part of our daily routine in space.锻炼是我们太空日常生活中重要的一部分。
[02:54.64]When we live in space, we start losing muscle.当我们生活在太空时，肌肉会开始流失。
[02:59.08]Exercise can slow down the muscle loss.锻炼可以减缓肌肉流失的速度。
[03:03.35]If we do not exercise, we will be very weak when we return to the Earth.如果不锻炼，我们返回地球时会变得非常虚弱。
[03:09.49]Luckily, we have a small gym on the space station to help us stay fit.幸运的是，空间站上有一个小型健身房，帮助我们保持健康。
[03:16.07]However, the exercise equipment is very different from what we use on Earth.但这些健身器材和我们在地球上使用的大不相同。

